EkranLink virtual display driver (this directory) — license notices
===================================================================

This directory is licensed separately from the rest of EkranLink (which is
GPL-3.0, see ../LICENSE). The driver is a separate program; the EkranLink
application talks to it only through device I/O control codes.

It is derived from, in order:

  1. Microsoft Windows-driver-samples, video/IndirectDisplay
     https://github.com/microsoft/Windows-driver-samples
     License: Microsoft Public License (MS-PL), reproduced in full below.
  2. Virtual-Display-Driver (IddSampleDriver by roshkins, baloukj and others)
     https://github.com/VirtualDrivers/Virtual-Display-Driver
     License: MIT, reproduced below.
  3. SudoVDA by SudoMaker
     https://github.com/SudoMaker/SudoVDA
     License (from its README): "MIT and CC0 or Public Domain (for changes I
     made, please consult Microsoft for their license), choose the least
     restrictive option."
  4. EkranLink changes, listed in README.md. License: MIT, reproduced below.

Because portions of this source come from the Microsoft sample, the source in
this directory as a whole is distributed under the MS-PL (section 3(D)). All
copyright notices present in the files are retained (section 3(C)).


